## Title: COA Pet Grid
## Notes: v0.2.0 - the Necromancer pet combat parser: a micro grid where the rows are your pets. Raise section = per-GUID rows (LF-weighted, HP %, fight dmg, crit/miss); Animate section = family rows (count, TTL window, rates). Liveness = buff-instance witness + TTLs (UNIT_DIED is silent for pets on this fork). All individuals fold into SV lifetime normals on close. Facts: addons/planning/pet_parser_scope.md. /petgrid for controls.
